des:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong> – Roll out with your squad and dominate the opposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free For All</strong> – Everyone’s your enemy. Be the last one rolling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun Game</strong> – Earn new weapons with every kill — no breaks, no mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Man Standing</strong> – One life. One shot at glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Team Standing</strong> – Team up, no respawns. Win or get wiped out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community, share your feedback, and help shape the future of <i>Wheels of Duty</i> </p>", "short_description": "After a deadly virus left humanity paralyzed, survivors now battle on wheels! Customize your rig, sharpen your aim, and roll into fast-paced wheelchair warfare across multiple maps and modes. Join the fight!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019950/header.jpg?t=1761325263", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761325263", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761325263", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> win 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> quad core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> gtx 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>